msgctxt "684_Saejima"
msgid "(So, what should I talk about?)"
msgstr "(Bueno, ¿qué podría decir?)."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "732_Watanabe"
msgid "You did that? That's terrible..."
msgstr "¿Hiciste eso? Terrible..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "744_Saejima"
msgid "(Guess he ain't a big fan o' the topic.)"
msgstr "(No creo que le agrade mucho el tema)."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "792_Watanabe"
msgid "Ohh! That's so cute! I didn't know you had such a sensitive side to you! You're a great person, Saejima-san."
msgstr "¡Ahh! ¡Qué lindo! ¡No sabía que tuvieses un lado adorable! Eres una gran persona, Saejima-san."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "804_Saejima"
msgid "(Looks like he opened up a bit. Perfect.)"
msgstr "(Parece que ya se soltó más. Perfecto)."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "852_Watanabe"
msgid "I remember those days. I used to do the same thing when I was studying for a test."
msgstr "Aún recuerdo esos días. Solía hacer lo mismo cuando estudiaba para un examen."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "864_Saejima"
msgid "(Guess that went okay.)"
msgstr "(Supongo que salió bien)."

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_role=decision
#. y4:msg_decision_role=prompt
#. y4:msg_decision_group=1
msgctxt "876_Saejima"
msgid "(So, what should I talk about?)"
msgstr "(Bueno, ¿qué podría decir?)."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "924_Watanabe"
msgid "Whaaat! That's scary! I don't think I can sleep tonight..."
msgstr "¡Qué miedo! No creo que vaya a poder dormir hoy..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "936_Saejima"
msgid "(Guess he ain't a big fan o' the topic.)"
msgstr "(No creo que le agrade mucho el tema)."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "984_Watanabe"
msgid "That's the perfect kind of movie for a date. But that doesn't really matter since I'm fat and girls don't like me."
msgstr "Ese tipo de película es perfecta para una cita. Pero no importa, estoy gordo y las chicas no gustan de mí."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "996_Saejima"
msgid "(Hmmm... That didn't make for very good conversation. But I guess it went okay.)"
msgstr "(Mmm... No fue una conversación. Pero creo que salió bien)."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1044_Watanabe"
msgid "Yeah, I love them! Those family movies are such tear-jerkers! I'm so glad we have the same taste in movies!"
msgstr "¡Sí, me encantan! Esas películas en familia son increíbles, me alegra que tengamos el mismo gusto."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1056_Saejima"
msgid "(That made for a great conversation. Couldn't have gone better.)"
msgstr "(La conversación salió de maravilla. No pudo haber salido mejor)."

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_role=decision
#. y4:msg_decision_role=prompt
#. y4:msg_decision_group=2
msgctxt "1068_Saejima"
msgid "(So, what should I talk about?)"
msgstr "(Bueno, ¿qué podría decir?)."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1116_Watanabe"
msgid "Sodachi is a really nice guy. Even though he acts irresponsible most of the time, he's actually very thoughtful. I really look up to him."
msgstr "Sodachi es bastante agradable. Aunque es irresponsable la mayoría del tiempo, es bastante fuerte. La verdad es que lo admiro mucho."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1128_Saejima"
msgid "(Looks like he opened up a bit. Perfect.)"
msgstr "(Parece que ya se soltó más. Perfecto)."

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1176_Watanabe"
msgid "Oh, let's not talk about me... I'm just a chicken."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1188_Saejima"
msgid "(That didn't make for much conversation.)"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1236_Watanabe"
msgid "Tokita-san is a truly amazing person, but I got him all angry. I'm sure he hates me now. What am I going to do...?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1248_Saejima"
msgid "(Looks like that depressed him. Shit...)"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_role=decision
#. y4:msg_decision_role=prompt
#. y4:msg_decision_group=3
msgctxt "1260_Saejima"
msgid "(So, what should I talk about?)"
msgstr "(Bueno, ¿qué podría decir?)."

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1308_Watanabe"
msgid "Maybe I <Italic>can</Italic> change...! I'm starting to feel revved up!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1320_Saejima"
msgid "(Looks like he's motivated now.)"
msgstr "(Parece que ahora está motivado.)"

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1368_Watanabe"
msgid "I see. A burning heart and a cool brain. That's some good advice."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1380_Saejima"
msgid "(Guess that went okay.)"
msgstr "(Creo que esto salió bien.)"

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1428_Watanabe"
msgid "Ha... haha..."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1440_Saejima"
msgid "(He didn't think it was that funny. May've even turned 'im off a little...)"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_role=decision
#. y4:msg_decision_role=prompt
#. y4:msg_decision_group=4
msgctxt "1452_Saejima"
msgid "(So, what should I talk about?)"
msgstr "(Bueno, ¿qué podría decir?)."

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1500_Watanabe"
msgid "Haha. That's amazing..."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1512_Saejima"
msgid "(Hm... Judgin' by that forced laugh, I may've given 'im a bad impression...)"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1560_Watanabe"
msgid "Even you had hard times like that, huh? But I guess you have to overcome rough times if you want to become a stronger person."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1572_Saejima"
msgid "(Good. Our relationship's grown stronger.)"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1620_Watanabe"
msgid "I see, so that's what turned you into a strong fighter. That's interesting."
msgstr "Ya veo, entonces fue eso lo que te volvió un luchador fuerte. Eso es interesante."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1632_Saejima"
msgid "(Guess that went okay.)"
msgstr "(Supongo que salió bien)."

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_role=decision
#. y4:msg_decision_role=prompt
#. y4:msg_decision_group=5
msgctxt "1644_Saejima"
msgid "(So, what should I talk about?)"
msgstr "(Bueno, ¿qué podría decir?)."

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1692_Watanabe"
msgid "Pure love is truly beautiful. I wish I was popular with the ladies. Then I could walk hand in hand around Kamurocho with a girl... Mmmm..."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1704_Saejima"
msgid "(Looks like he opened up a bit. Perfect.)"
msgstr "(Parece que ya se soltó más. Perfecto)."

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1752_Watanabe"
msgid "That's terrible. Hurting others just to boost one's own happiness! It's despicable! It really ticks me off actually!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1764_Saejima"
msgid "(Looks like he don't like this topic...)"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1812_Watanabe"
msgid "I don't think it's a good thing..."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1824_Watanabe"
msgid "But if I had a wife and she cheated on me, I'd bet it was my fault anyway. So I'd probably forgive her."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1836_Saejima"
msgid "(Guess that went okay.)"
msgstr "(Supongo que salió bien)."

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1872_Watanabe"
msgid "Are you sure you want to choose me as your last apprentice?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1884_Saejima"
msgid "Well, why wouldn't I?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
#. y4:msg_role=decision
#. y4:msg_decision_role=prompt
#. y4:msg_decision_group=6
msgctxt "1896_Watanabe"
msgid "Because I'm just an ordinary guy who's only good at being nice to others. I'm an untalented fat-ass..."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1908_Saejima"
msgid "Sure, you may be a little overweight, but that ain't a good reason to talk shit about yerself."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1920_Saejima"
msgid "You've got great strength. It separates you from the rest o' the pack."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1932_Watanabe"
msgid "Separates me...?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1944_Saejima"
msgid "Yeah. Stop thinkin' of everythin' in a negative light. You gotta see yer personal qualities in a positive way. It's somethin' you gotta work on."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1956_Watanabe"
msgid "You're right... I've always thought of my size as a negative quality."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1968_Watanabe"
msgid "I have to think about myself more positively. I might have strengths that I never even knew about."
msgstr "Tengo que pensar en mí mismo de una manera más positiva. Puede que tenga fortalezas que ni siquiera conocía."

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1980_Saejima"
msgid "(Well, he seems more positive now. I'm glad I invited 'im out for drinks.)"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1992_Saejima"
msgid "Talent ain't everything. Effort n' bravery can easily defeat it."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2004_Watanabe"
msgid "But if that's the case, it would be best to work with someone who has some talent, right? Why did you choose me?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2016_Watanabe"
msgid "Sigh... I feel bad that I'm going to be your last apprentice. I'm really sorry."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2028_Saejima"
msgid "(Looks like he's even more depressed than before. That didn't go well.)"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2040_Saejima"
msgid "No, you got some incredible talent. I guarantee it."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "2052_Watanabe"
msgid "Haha... You're really nice, Saejima-san. Thanks for your kind words."
msgstr "Jaja... Eres muy agradable, Saejima-san. Te agradezco por tus amables palabras."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "2064_Watanabe"
msgid "I feel a little bit better now."
msgstr "Me siento un poco mejor ahora."

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2076_Saejima"
msgid "(Huh. Guess that went okay.)"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "2088_Watanabe"
msgid "To tell you the truth, I've been bullied since I was little."
msgstr "Si te digo la verdad, me han hecho matoneo desde que era pequeño."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "2100_Saejima"
msgid "Bullied?"
msgstr "¿Matoneo?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "2112_Watanabe"
msgid "Yeah. People made fun of me for being fat and the fact that I'm a chicken. I'm a fat chicken. I had some pretty hard times."
msgstr "Sí, matoneo. La gente se ha reído de mí por ser gordo y por ser una gallina. Soy una gallina gorda. Han sido tiempos dificiles."

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2124_Watanabe"
msgid "But I never had the guts to stand up for myself, or to ask someone else for help. It's pathetic, really..."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2136_Watanabe"
msgid "That's when I figured out a way to escape the harassment. I began sucking up to the bullies, so they wouldn't hate me so much."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "2148_Saejima"
msgid "......"
msgstr "......"

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2160_Watanabe"
msgid "I was basically their servant. I'd do anything for them. It was really frustrating."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "2172_Watanabe"
msgid "But it did stop me from getting bullied all of the time."
msgstr "Pero eso paró que me acosaran todo el tiempo."

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2184_Watanabe"
msgid "And that's how it all started. That's why I act the way I do today."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2196_Watanabe"
msgid "I started neglecting my own feelings and only worrying about what others would think about me."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
#. y4:msg_role=decision
#. y4:msg_decision_role=prompt
#. y4:msg_decision_group=7
msgctxt "2208_Watanabe"
msgid "I joined the dojo in hopes that it would help me change this pathetic personality of mine. What do you think I should do to change?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2220_Saejima"
msgid "The thing ya lack most is confidence. That's why you're always scared about others hatin' you for bein' a loser."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2232_Saejima"
msgid "You gotta gain some confidence first. And trainin' hard is the way to do it."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2244_Watanabe"
msgid "Training...?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2256_Saejima"
msgid "That's right. If ya keep workin' hard, you'll be able to think, \"I trained real hard. There ain't no reason why I can't win!\""
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2268_Saejima"
msgid "Confidence is created from continued effort, but it ain't just about winnin'."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2280_Saejima"
msgid "You gotta learn to have positive thoughts about yerself, even if ya lose. That's the most important thing."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2292_Watanabe"
msgid "Being positive even if I lose... That's a good philosophy. I'm going to give it my best!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2304_Saejima"
msgid "(Looks like he's real motivated now. That's great.)"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2316_Saejima"
msgid "You gotta win fights. Winnin' lotsa fights is sure to give ya more confidence."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2328_Watanabe"
msgid "Winning fights, huh? Maybe you're right. If I win, I'll have a way to evaluate myself objectively."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2340_Watanabe"
msgid "I just have to win. That means I have to work harder so that I <Italic>can</Italic> win..."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2352_Saejima"
msgid "(Wish I could've cheered 'im up more.)"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2364_Saejima"
msgid "If ya can't stop bein' nice to people, why don't ya try bein' mean to 'em?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2376_Watanabe"
msgid "Er... But do you think that will really help me change my personality?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2388_Watanabe"
msgid "If that was all it took, I could've changed a long time ago."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2400_Saejima"
msgid "(Looks like he's lost some trust in me. That didn't go well.)"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2412_Saejima"
msgid "By the way, you got a hobby or somethin'?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2424_Watanabe"
msgid "A hobby? Well, I like to watch DVDs."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2436_Saejima"
msgid "Dee vee dees? What the fuck are those?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
#. y4:msg_role=decision
#. y4:msg_decision_role=prompt
#. y4:msg_decision_group=8
msgctxt "2448_Watanabe"
msgid "Huh!? You don't know what a DVD is!?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2460_Saejima"
msgid "I got no clue. Haven't really been following what's goin' on in the world lately."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2472_Watanabe"
msgid "I see. DVDs are like video tapes. It's a way to watch movies at home."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2484_Watanabe"
msgid "Put more simply, it's like the video version of a CD. Get it? I'll let you borrow one sometime."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2496_Saejima"
msgid "(What the heck's a cee dee?)"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2508_Saejima"
msgid "Oh, dee vee dees. That's a pretty good hobby. As yer teacher, I'm proud of ya."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2520_Watanabe"
msgid "Huh? Is it that great of a hobby? Uh, thank you! I'm happy to be praised by you, Saejima-san."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2532_Saejima"
msgid "(That was some pretty good bullshittin'.)"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2544_Saejima"
msgid "How the fuck am I supposed to know!? Huh!? You fuckin' idiot!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2556_Watanabe"
msgid "Huh!? Why are you getting mad at me!? That's so unfair..."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2568_Saejima"
msgid "(Maybe gettin' mad wasn't the best idea...)"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2580_Saejima"
msgid "Y'know, champions earn loads o' money. Whaddya gonna buy once you're champion? A car? A gold watch?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2592_Watanabe"
msgid "Hmm... Well, if I win, I want to switch out my TV for a plasma-type, compatible with digital terrestrial broadcasting. Mine is so old."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "2604_Saejima"
msgid "Plasma...? Digital terrestrial...?"
msgstr "¿Plasma...? ¿Digital Terrestre...?"

#. y4:line_status=todo
#. y4:msg_role=decision
#. y4:msg_decision_role=prompt
#. y4:msg_decision_group=9
msgctxt "2616_Watanabe"
msgid "It was always my dream to watch movies on a big screen at home. The newest LCD TVs are really impressive, aren't they? What do you think?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2628_Saejima"
msgid "Hmmm... I don't really think so. I've always thought the thicker the better."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "2640_Watanabe"
msgid "What?"
msgstr "¿Qué?"

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2652_Saejima"
msgid "Yep. We're talkin' about TVs, right? A thin TV lacks power, so it ain't gonna be that impressive. You get what I'm sayin'?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2664_Watanabe"
msgid "Oh... Right... Haha! Saejima-san, you really caught me off guard there! You jokester!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "2676_Watanabe"
msgid "That was funny. Hahaha."
msgstr "Eso fue divertido. Jajajaja."

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2688_Saejima"
msgid "(What a weird guy...)"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2700_Saejima"
msgid "Oh, yeah... I think so. For sure... The thinner the better."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2712_Watanabe"
msgid "Right. I guess my little dream may just come true if I become champion."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2724_Saejima"
msgid "Yeah. 'Course it will."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2736_Watanabe"
msgid "All right! I feel really motivated now! I'm gonna start working harder!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2748_Saejima"
msgid "(Don't get what just happened, but it looks like he's motivated. All's well that ends well.)"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2760_Saejima"
msgid "Wait, what the hell's a \"plasma\"?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2772_Watanabe"
msgid "Huh...? It's one of those flat screen TVs... Never seen one before?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2784_Saejima"
msgid "I ain't got a clue what yer talkin' about. I ain't heard of digital terrestrial, either. What is that? Got somethin' to do with airplanes?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2796_Watanabe"
msgid "No... You should get caught up with the times, Saejima-san."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2808_Watanabe"
msgid "I wonder if it's really safe to trust this guy as my teacher..."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2820_Saejima"
msgid "(Huh... Looks like he's lost some trust in me.)"
msgstr ""

